1
00:00:08,636 --> 00:00:14,448
♪Myriad delusions cut like knives♪

2
00:00:14,448 --> 00:00:20,416
♪Crushing the moon in the ancient well♪

3
00:00:20,598 --> 00:00:25,536
♪Lost in this life,
I never ask about tomorrow♪

4
00:00:25,536 --> 00:00:31,216
♪When love runs deep,
the moonlight fades♪

5
00:00:32,000 --> 00:00:39,851
♪A cursed fate,
a dream severed over lifetimes♪

6
00:00:40,662 --> 00:00:44,310
=Braving the Famine with My Wife=

7
00:00:44,599 --> 00:00:46,778
=Episode 6=

8
00:01:07,640 --> 00:01:09,060
(He's cold as a rock.)

9
00:01:09,219 --> 00:01:10,439
(Let's see you cure him.)

10
00:01:10,819 --> 00:01:11,980
(All signs of life are gone.)

11
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:14,780
(The spirit has left the body.
He's dead.)

12
00:01:14,780 --> 00:01:15,780
What?

13
00:01:16,299 --> 00:01:17,459
Can't keep it up?

14
00:01:17,719 --> 00:01:18,959
You're done for.

15
00:01:23,239 --> 00:01:26,000
Only the Nine Heaven-Defying Needles

16
00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:27,719
can pierce through life and death

17
00:01:28,939 --> 00:01:31,599
and snatch a life back
from the King of Underworld now.

18
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:11,719
Let energy settle.

19
00:02:12,379 --> 00:02:13,860
Let the spirit dwell.

20
00:02:14,460 --> 00:02:15,879
Infuse primordial life.

21
00:02:16,319 --> 00:02:17,780
Blood and breath swell.

22
00:02:19,419 --> 00:02:20,419
At my command!

23
00:02:36,639 --> 00:02:38,960
Zhao Laizi, the show's over?

24
00:02:40,039 --> 00:02:41,240
Putting on all that act,

25
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,599
you take us for fools?

26
00:02:42,979 --> 00:02:46,020
Someone! Seize these three!

27
00:02:46,340 --> 00:02:47,819
If they resist,

28
00:02:48,300 --> 00:02:49,419
kill them on the spot.

29
00:02:57,780 --> 00:02:58,780
Well...

30
00:03:01,580 --> 00:03:03,919
Am I in the underworld?

31
00:03:05,020 --> 00:03:06,020
Unbelievable!

32
00:03:06,199 --> 00:03:07,199
Am I in the underworld?

33
00:03:07,199 --> 00:03:08,819
Even Master Zhang rises from the dead.

34
00:03:08,819 --> 00:03:10,919
Father, you're awake!

35
00:03:10,919 --> 00:03:11,919
Son.

36
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:15,740
You... You're not dead too, are you?

37
00:03:16,020 --> 00:03:17,419
Impressive.

38
00:03:18,780 --> 00:03:19,780
Thank you.

39
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:21,680
See?

40
00:03:21,680 --> 00:03:23,520
(Affection +95)
Now you know how amazing Dong is.

41
00:03:23,979 --> 00:03:25,120
Is this for real?

42
00:03:25,219 --> 00:03:27,360
How is this possible?

43
00:03:27,360 --> 00:03:28,480
(Affection -60)

44
00:03:29,099 --> 00:03:30,099
Dong,

45
00:03:30,099 --> 00:03:31,099
you're amazing!

46
00:03:31,699 --> 00:03:32,780
If you are so capable,

47
00:03:32,879 --> 00:03:34,120
we'll be set for life.

48
00:03:35,960 --> 00:03:37,020
(Impossible.)

49
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:39,060
(I know Zhao Laizi inside and out.)

50
00:03:39,639 --> 00:03:41,139
(He's no miracle doctor.)

51
00:03:42,879 --> 00:03:44,340
(You slept with my wife.)

52
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,460
(I have to kill you!)

53
00:03:48,479 --> 00:03:49,780
Help my father to his room.

54
00:03:50,020 --> 00:03:51,020
- Yes.
- Yes.

55
00:03:51,120 --> 00:03:52,120
Careful, Master.

56
00:03:52,120 --> 00:03:54,560
- Amazing!
- Zhao Laizi's really a great physician.

57
00:03:56,539 --> 00:03:58,819
Master, what reward do you want?

58
00:03:59,060 --> 00:04:00,120
I can give you anything.

59
00:04:01,439 --> 00:04:03,719
I only ask for 30 jin of grain.

60
00:04:04,740 --> 00:04:05,740
Three years of drought,

61
00:04:05,740 --> 00:04:06,740
the people are destitute.

62
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:08,000
As for anything extra,

63
00:04:08,340 --> 00:04:11,419
please distribute
to the villagers in need.

64
00:04:14,780 --> 00:04:17,279
Dong, please reconsider.

65
00:04:17,819 --> 00:04:19,920
Our family has no grain to spare,

66
00:04:20,279 --> 00:04:22,519
and we have so many mouths to feed.

67
00:04:23,899 --> 00:04:25,360
Turning down a generous reward

68
00:04:25,519 --> 00:04:26,980
just for 30 jin of grain?

69
00:04:27,180 --> 00:04:28,519
That's just foolish.

70
00:04:28,720 --> 00:04:30,100
Master Zhao is kind and skilled.

71
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:31,600
This is the mark of a true physician.

72
00:04:32,620 --> 00:04:33,879
A true miracle physician!

73
00:04:34,279 --> 00:04:36,040
Master Zhao is both kind and skilled.

74
00:04:36,040 --> 00:04:37,300
A miracle physician indeed!

75
00:04:37,439 --> 00:04:38,439
(Very well.)

76
00:04:38,579 --> 00:04:40,220
(Dong is so capable.)

77
00:04:40,399 --> 00:04:41,939
(We'll have everything soon enough.)

78
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:45,860
He has such a generous heart.

79
00:04:46,579 --> 00:04:48,180
(Affection -30)
I misjudged him before.

80
00:04:48,980 --> 00:04:50,240
(Officials serve the people.)

81
00:04:50,699 --> 00:04:52,399
(Physicians also serve the people.)

82
00:04:52,519 --> 00:04:53,879
I almost

83
00:04:53,879 --> 00:04:56,019
(Affection +50)
saw my father's shadow in him.

84
00:04:56,759 --> 00:04:59,060
Very well,
as the divine physician suggests.

85
00:04:59,680 --> 00:05:00,680
Make it so.

86
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:01,680
Yes.

87
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:05,720
Thank you.

88
00:05:10,339 --> 00:05:11,339
You.

89
00:05:12,279 --> 00:05:13,680
Your face is ashen,

90
00:05:13,920 --> 00:05:15,639
with red lines appearing
between your brows.

91
00:05:16,639 --> 00:05:19,300
This is the White Tiger Omen
of impending doom.

92
00:05:20,839 --> 00:05:22,379
This man's fate is marked by conflict.

93
00:05:22,540 --> 00:05:24,160
Such a person ruins
his master's fortune.

94
00:05:24,839 --> 00:05:25,920
If you keep him close,

95
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,819
it will harm
your virtue and official career.

96
00:05:30,019 --> 00:05:32,899
You... You're spouting nonsense! You...

97
00:05:32,899 --> 00:05:33,899
Enough, Wang Xu!

98
00:05:34,420 --> 00:05:35,540
You insulted Master Zhao

99
00:05:35,699 --> 00:05:36,959
and nearly killed my father.

100
00:05:37,500 --> 00:05:39,360
Now you dare
to spout more nonsense here?

101
00:05:39,779 --> 00:05:41,879
Sir, I'm innocent!

102
00:05:41,879 --> 00:05:42,879
Get lost!

103
00:05:49,579 --> 00:05:50,579
By the way, Master Zhao,

104
00:05:50,839 --> 00:05:54,339
the County Magistrate invited a master
to pray for rain the day after tomorrow.

105
00:05:54,500 --> 00:05:55,579
If you are free,

106
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,819
please come and observe.

107
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:03,339
(A blood calamity)

108
00:06:03,959 --> 00:06:04,959
(is coming.)

109
00:06:06,259 --> 00:06:07,259
Alright.

110
00:06:07,360 --> 00:06:09,639
I will be there to observe.

111
00:06:12,144 --> 00:06:16,800
(Zhang Mansion)

112
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:19,740
Dong, why are you leaving me here
to distribute the relief grain?

113
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:21,980
Are you having me watch over something?

114
00:06:23,439 --> 00:06:25,899
The Zhang family has an auspicious aura
of wealth and honor.

115
00:06:26,500 --> 00:06:28,199
They won't skim from the relief grain.

116
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,920
I'm leaving you here

117
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:31,720
because your tribulation is coming.

118
00:06:31,720 --> 00:06:33,540
Tribulation? What tribulation?

119
00:06:34,959 --> 00:06:36,339
Heaven's secrets can't be spoken.

120
00:06:37,120 --> 00:06:38,800
But you must always remember my words.

121
00:06:39,079 --> 00:06:41,199
Maintain a sincere and kind heart.

122
00:06:41,399 --> 00:06:43,399
Dong, I'll do as you say.

123
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:49,199
Keep this pouch safe, no matter what.

124
00:06:50,379 --> 00:06:51,379
Yes.

125
00:06:53,120 --> 00:06:55,579
Master, the carriage is ready.

126
00:06:56,740 --> 00:06:58,639
Let's go.

127
00:06:58,639 --> 00:06:59,639
Dong.

128
00:07:00,500 --> 00:07:01,500
Well...

129
00:07:18,399 --> 00:07:19,399
Hanyan.

130
00:07:21,800 --> 00:07:22,920
You called me?

131
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,459
There are only three of us
in this carriage.

132
00:07:26,680 --> 00:07:28,259
Dong was looking at you when he spoke.

133
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:30,139
Who else would he be calling?

134
00:07:32,959 --> 00:07:34,220
What do you want?

135
00:07:35,740 --> 00:07:38,639
Do you remember our bet?

136
00:07:40,019 --> 00:07:43,220
I...

137
00:07:45,879 --> 00:07:48,000
So does the bet still stand?

138
00:07:48,560 --> 00:07:49,639
I did win.

139
00:07:52,620 --> 00:07:55,579
It stands. Of course, it stands.

140
00:07:56,779 --> 00:07:57,779
It's just that...

141
00:07:58,800 --> 00:07:59,879
Well...

142
00:08:03,779 --> 00:08:05,980
Can you give me some time?

143
00:08:07,980 --> 00:08:09,639
I'm not ready yet.

144
00:08:15,779 --> 00:08:16,779
Forget it.

145
00:08:17,839 --> 00:08:19,019
What do you mean?

146
00:08:20,259 --> 00:08:23,000
It's a matter of mutual consent.

147
00:08:23,220 --> 00:08:25,500
If you're unwilling,
I will never force you.

148
00:08:26,259 --> 00:08:28,399
Let's forget the bet.

149
00:08:28,680 --> 00:08:29,680
Don't worry about it.

150
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:34,379
You're really willing to let it go?

151
00:08:35,940 --> 00:08:36,940
Of course.

152
00:08:36,940 --> 00:08:37,940
Wan'er is here.

153
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:38,940
She can be our witness.

154
00:08:43,100 --> 00:08:44,120
Thank you.

155
00:08:44,976 --> 00:08:46,368
(Affection +55)

156
00:08:49,059 --> 00:08:50,100
Hanyan,

157
00:08:50,480 --> 00:08:52,639
Dong's word is his bond.

158
00:08:52,740 --> 00:08:54,440
You've missed your chance.

159
00:08:54,580 --> 00:08:56,379
Even I feel sorry for you.

160
00:08:56,919 --> 00:08:58,960
You've seen Dong's character and skill

161
00:08:58,960 --> 00:09:00,179
with your own eyes.

162
00:09:00,940 --> 00:09:04,960
We're blessed to be married to him.

163
00:09:08,399 --> 00:09:10,700
(Hanyan has deep worries
and unresolved feelings.)

164
00:09:11,299 --> 00:09:14,159
(I need to find a way
to help her open up.)

165
00:09:22,039 --> 00:09:25,240
Zhao Laizi, you'll die today!

166
00:09:43,730 --> 00:09:47,321
♪With a clap of thunder,
you were cast into the mortal realm♪

167
00:09:47,321 --> 00:09:50,108
♪Silk robes replaced by rags♪

168
00:09:50,684 --> 00:09:52,846
♪Immortal bones buried in the dust♪

169
00:09:52,846 --> 00:09:55,692
♪One thought once stirred the seas♪

170
00:09:55,692 --> 00:09:58,970
♪Now, even cold porridge
is a lucky find♪

171
00:09:58,970 --> 00:10:00,604
♪She was cast out of the golden hall♪

172
00:10:00,604 --> 00:10:02,668
♪With only half a tattered decree♪

173
00:10:02,668 --> 00:10:04,204
♪Her eyes still held a blade's edge♪

174
00:10:04,204 --> 00:10:06,986
♪Saying this world
isn't worth a single moment♪

175
00:10:07,435 --> 00:10:09,340
♪You handed her a bowl of coarse tea♪

176
00:10:09,340 --> 00:10:15,371
♪Telling her to taste
life's bitter and sweet♪

177
00:10:15,953 --> 00:10:19,836
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

178
00:10:19,836 --> 00:10:23,061
♪So the Empress
can feel her heart turn cold♪

179
00:10:23,573 --> 00:10:26,172
♪You watched the sunset
in a narrow alley with her♪

180
00:10:26,172 --> 00:10:31,300
♪Hearing a child cry out in pain,
yet still laughing, so silly♪

181
00:10:31,300 --> 00:10:34,828
♪So power is no match
for a bowl of warm porridge♪

182
00:10:34,828 --> 00:10:38,536
♪So heaven can't compare
to a lamp in a broken hut♪

183
00:10:38,536 --> 00:10:40,428
♪From strangers to aching hearts♪

184
00:10:40,428 --> 00:10:42,505
♪From cold words to genuine care♪

185
00:10:42,505 --> 00:10:45,036
♪In the humblest corners
of the mortal world♪

186
00:10:45,036 --> 00:10:49,073
♪You met the most precious person♪

187
00:10:50,741 --> 00:10:52,604
♪She said commoners are just numbers♪

188
00:10:52,604 --> 00:10:55,123
♪You took her to see
the fields turned to scars♪

189
00:10:55,123 --> 00:10:56,572
♪And the old man bent by firewood♪

190
00:10:56,572 --> 00:10:58,874
♪A lifetime of bitterness
on his shoulders♪

191
00:10:58,874 --> 00:11:00,844
♪For the first time,
she set aside her crown♪

192
00:11:00,844 --> 00:11:05,254
♪And held an umbrella
for a drenched street vendor♪

193
00:11:05,254 --> 00:11:06,796
♪You can no longer ride the clouds♪

194
00:11:06,796 --> 00:11:08,706
♪But only toss and turn in the night♪

195
00:11:08,706 --> 00:11:11,980
♪Still kneeling at Heaven's Gate
in your dreams♪

196
00:11:11,980 --> 00:11:15,301
♪Only to wake up
with a flatbread she tossed at you♪

197
00:11:15,301 --> 00:11:17,036
♪Saying, forget the gods♪

198
00:11:17,036 --> 00:11:21,660
♪Just catch your breath first♪

199
00:11:21,660 --> 00:11:25,410
♪So the Supreme Immortal
can fall to dust♪

200
00:11:25,410 --> 00:11:28,788
♪So the Empress can turn for someone♪

201
00:11:29,162 --> 00:11:31,132
♪No longer asking
who stands higher or mightier♪

202
00:11:31,132 --> 00:11:36,879
♪Only asking who stands
at your heart's door now♪

203
00:11:36,879 --> 00:11:40,395
♪If Heaven wants you to pass
through the street's rising smoke first♪

204
00:11:40,395 --> 00:11:41,964
♪If the mortal world cannot hold you♪

205
00:11:41,964 --> 00:11:44,274
♪Then carve the memories
into your palm lines♪

206
00:11:44,274 --> 00:11:46,012
♪From laughter to devotion♪

207
00:11:46,012 --> 00:11:48,068
♪From falling to innocence♪

208
00:11:48,068 --> 00:11:49,916
♪If there's a next life, you'll still♪

209
00:11:49,916 --> 00:11:56,586
♪Love a mortal once more
amidst this suffering♪
